hadiths[74]{hadithnumber,text}:
"444","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Ujrah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya jab juon ne mujhe takleef di ke main apna sar mundun, phir teen din roza rakhun ya chhe miskeenon ko khana khilaon. Aap jaan chuke the ke mere paas woh nahin jis se main qurbani karun."
"445","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Ujrah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the; juon ne unhen takleef di. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen apna sar mundne ka hukm diya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Teen din roza rakho, ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao: Har insan ke liye do do mudd, ya bakri zibah karo. Tum jo bhi karo tumhari taraf se kafi hai.' Tahawi kehte hain: Main ne Muzani aur Muhammad bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hadees mein ghalati ki; huffaz ne use Abdul-Karim se Mujahid se Abdir Rahman bin Abi Laila se Ka'b bin Ujrah se yaad farmaya. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Malik ne us mein ghalati nahin ki; Yunus ne ham ko bayan farmaya: Ibn Wahb ne ham ko khabar di ke Malik ne unhen Abdul-Karim bin Malik Jazari se Mujahid se Abdir Rahman bin Abi Laila se Ka'b bin Ujrah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi khabar di. Ravi kehte hain: Yeh is liye ke Malik ne us mein ghalati nahin ki; ghalati ghair se thi, siwae majlis ke jisme Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) hazir the: Malik ne us mein Mujahid ka zikr nahin farmaya is hadees mein."
"446","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Ujrah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Shayad tumhari juen tumhen takleef deti hain?' Ravi kehte hain: Main ne kaha: Ji. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apna sar mundo, teen din roza rakho, ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao, ya bakri zibah karo.' Abu Ja'far ne ham ko bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ne ham ko bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Ashhab ne Malik se ham ko bayan farmaya; unhon ne aisi hi apni sanad ke sath zikr farmaya."
"447","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Ujrah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hudaibiyah mein mere paas se guzre jabke main handi ke neeche aag jala raha tha; juen mere sar se gir rahi thin. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Ai Ka'b, kya tumhari juen tumhen takleef deti hain?' Ravi kehte hain: 'To apna sar mundo, bakri zibah karo, ya teen din roza rakho, ya chhe miskeenon ke darmiyan faraq [bada paimana] khilao.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Rabi bin Sulaiman ko kehte suna: Main ne Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ko farmate suna: Hudaibiyah takhfeef ke sath [baghair tashdeed]."
"448","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Ujrah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hudaibiyah ke zamane mein mere paas tashreef lae jabke main zyada baalon wala tha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Goya tumhare sar ki juen tumhen takleef deti hain?' Ravi kehte hain: Main ne kaha: Ji. Aap ne farmaya: 'To use mundo, bakri fidyah ke taur par zibah karo, ya teen din roza rakho, ya teen sa khajoor chhe miskeenon ke darmiyan sadqa karo.'"
"449","[AI-translation] Ka'b bin Ujrah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Malik ki Abdul-Karim Jazari se hadees jaisi riwayat hai."
"450","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha), Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hajjatul-wada mein ehram bandha; main un mein thi jo umrah se tamattu karte aur hadi sath nahin lae. Unhon ne khayal farmaya ke woh haiza huin aur Arafah ki raat dakhil hone tak pak nahin huin. Ravi kehte hain: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh Arafah ka din hai jabke main abhi pak nahin hui; main ne umrah se tamattu kiya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apna sar kholo, kanghi karo, hajj ka ehram bandho, apne umrah ko chhor do [hajj ifrad banao].' To main ne kiya. Jab ham ne hajj ada kiya aur log rawan hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdir Rahman bin Abi Bakr ko hukm diya; unhon ne mujhe Tan'eem se umrah karaya mere us umrah ke badle jo main ne chhora tha."
"451","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Aap ke hajj mein nikle; ham sirf hajj samajhte the. Yahan tak ke jab ham Sarif mein ya us ke qareeb the to main haiza hui. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef lae jabke main ro rahi thi. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhara kya mamla hai, kya tum haiza hui ho?' To main ne kaha: Ji. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh mamla hai jo Allah ne Banaat Adam par likha hai; woh karo jo haji karta hai siwae is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf na karo.' Ravi kehte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se gae qurban farmai."
"452","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdir Rahman bin Abi Bakr [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke Aishah ko sawari par bithayen; unhen Tan'eem se umrah karayen."
"453","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hajjatul-wada wale saal nikle; ham ne umrah ka ehram bandha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ke paas hadi ho woh umrah ke sath hajj ka ehram bandhe, phir halal na ho yahan tak ke dono se ikatthe halal ho.' Ravi kehte hain: Main Makkah aayi jabke haiza thi; Baitullah ka tawaf nahin kiya aur na Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan. To main ne is ki shikayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ki. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Apna sar kholo, kanghi karo, hajj ka ehram bandho, umrah chhor do.' Ravi kehte hain: To main ne kiya. Jab main ne hajj ada kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe Abdir Rahman bin Abi Bakr ke sath Tan'eem bheja; main ne umrah kiya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh tumhare umrah ki jagah hai.' Ravi kehte hain: Jin logon ne umrah ka ehram bandha unhon ne Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan [sa'i] ki, phir halal hue, phir Mina se wapas aane ke ba'd apne hajj ke liye dusra tawaf kiya. Rahi jinhon ne hajj ka ehram bandha ya hajj aur umrah jama kiye, unhon ne sirf ek tawaf kiya."
"454","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Makkah aayi jabke haiza thi; Baitullah ka tawaf nahin kiya aur na Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan. To main ne is ki shikayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ki. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh karo jo haji karta hai siwae is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf pak hone tak na karo.'"
"455","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Zulqa'dah ki paanch raaten baqi the nikle; ham sirf hajj samajhte the. Jab ham Makkah ke qareeb hue to 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya jo ke paas hadi na ho jab Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan sa'i kare to halal ho.' Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain: To yomun-Nahr mujhe gae ka gosht dakhil hua; main ne kaha: Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ke liye gae zibah ki. Yahya kehte hain: Main ne yeh hadees Qasim bin Muhammad se zikr ki; unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh tumhare paas hadees us ke chehre par laya."
"456","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Zulqa'dah ki paanch baqi par nikle; ham sirf hajj samajhte the. Jab ham Sarif mein ya us ke qareeb the to 'Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya jo ke paas hadi na ho ke use umrah banae.' Jab ham Mina mein the to mujhe gae ka gosht laya gaya; main ne kaha: Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ke liye zibah farmaya. Yahya kehte hain: Main ne use Qasim bin Muhammad ko bayan ki; unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh hadees us ke chehre par laya."
"457","[AI-translation] Amrah bint Abdir Rahman (Rahimahallah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Aishah ko kehte suna: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Zulqa'dah ki paanch baqi par nikle; ham sirf hajj samajhte the. Yahan tak ke jab ham Makkah ke qareeb hue to 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya jo ke paas hadi na ho jab Baitullah ka tawaf kare to halal ho.' Ravi kehte hain: To yomun-Nahr mujhe gae ka gosht dakhil hua; main ne kaha: Yeh kya hai? Kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ke liye gae se zibah farmaya. Yahya kehte hain: Main ne yeh hadees Qasim bin Muhammad se zikr ki; unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh tumhare paas hadees us ke chehre par laya. Ahmad ne ham ko bayan farmaya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Jabir bin Abdullah ki hadees, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Taus ki hadees, Yahya bin Sa'id ki Amrah aur Qasim bin Muhammad se Aishah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees, aur Abdir Rahman bin Qasim ki apne walid se Aishah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees sab muttafiq hain. Kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ehram bandhte nikle ehram ki niyyat karte, intezar karte jo Allah Azz wa Jall Apne Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par faisla farmaye un ke ehram ke anjam ke bare mein: Kya use hajj banayen, wahi jo woh hajj ke mahinon mein jante the, woh hajj ke mahinon mein umrah nahin jante the, ya use umrah banayen? Ya dono ko jama karen? Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par faisla nazil hua to Aap ne hukm diya jo ke paas hadi na ho ke use umrah banae; yeh un ke tawaf se pehle tha. To unhon ne pehli niyyat ke ba'd nai niyyat ki; us se unhon ne apne ehram ke darmiyan farq jana: Un mein se jo hajj ifrad wala hua, woh hadi wale the jo use sath lae the; un mein se jo tamattu wala hua, woh the jin ke paas hadi nahin thi. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: In ahadees mein us ki wazahat hai jo main ne bayan kiya; chaar ka ek se zyada hafiz hona awla hai. Ghalati sirf us ne ki jo Urwah ki hadees bayan karta hai ke Aishah umrah se ehram bandhne wali thin, ek jihat se jo aisi se ghalat ho sakti hai: Woh ye ke us ne Aishah ko kehte suna: Mujhe apne umrah se khamosh rehne ka hukm diya gaya; main ne apne umrah ki jagah umrah kiya; mera tawaf mere hajj aur umrah ke liye kafi hua. To sunne wale ne use suna ho sakta hai ke us ne hadees ka awwal yaad na rakha ho; us ke nazdeek ho ke woh mu'tamirah nahin siwae is ke ke us ne umrah se ehram shuru kiya ho; woh us se bayan kare ke woh umrah se ehram bandhne wali thi. Jabke us ka ehram umrah hua us ke ba'd ke us ne use bandha jaisa logon ne bandha, faisle ka intezar karte jaisa woh intezar karte. Use hukm diya gaya ke apne ehram ko umrah banae un ke jumle mein jin ke paas hadi nahin thi jabke us ke paas hadi nahin thi. Yehi woh jagah hai jahan se Urwah ki hadees bayan karne wala aaya. Qasim aur Amrah ke Aishah se hadees mein ikhtilaf ki wajah se, do ka ek se zyada hafiz hona ashbah hai; agar dono mushtabah hon to jaiz hai; kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisa bayan hua jaisa Qasim aur Amrah ne Aishah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya; un dono ke liye hifz ki jagah sabit karta hai. Isi tarah Taus kyunke use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan kiya. Agar istidlal na hota jo main ne bayan kiya aur aisi se, to ham hadees mein khata aur sawab ke darmiyan na nikalte. Abu Ja'far ne ham se kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Agar koi kahe: Us hadees ka kya ma'na hai jo Urwah se Aishah se bayan hoti hai? Ham kehte hain: Ham use sabit karte hain; ham sirf us ke sabit karne ko chhorte hain jisme us ki mukhalifat ki us se ghair ne jo us se tadad mein zyada hain. Rahi jo us ki mukhalifat kisi ne nahin ki, woh lafz ghair lafz hai jisme us ki mukhalifat ki gayi, mamla ghair mamla hai jisme us ki mukhalifat ki gayi; ham use sabit karte hain jab us mein mukhalif na ho."
"458","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap jab hajj ya umrah ke liye tawaf farmate pehli aamad mein, Baitullah ke teen pheron mein daudte aur chaar mein chalte, phir do rak'aten padhte, phir Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan tawaf [sa'i] farmate."
"459","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im [Raziyallahu anhu] se apne walid se riwayat hai ke ek aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi; us ne Aap se kisi cheez ke bare mein poocha; Aap ne use wapas aane ka hukm diya. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, agar main wapas aaon aur Aap ko na paon? Goya maut murad thi. Aap ne farmaya: 'To Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aao.'"
"460","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Ja'far bin Abi Talib [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamari waliayat ki: Allah Azz wa Jall ke behtareen khalifa; ham par sab se rehem farmane wale aur sab se narm.'"
"461","[AI-translation] Nafi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar kaha karte: 'Muhrim hajj ya umrah se halal nahin hota jise bala [beemari/rukawat] roke yahan tak ke Baitullah ka tawaf kare, siwae jise dushman roke; woh wahin halal ho jahan roka gaya. Jo umrah mein bala se roka gaya woh apni hurmat par raha yahan tak ke Baitullah Atiq ka tawaf kare phir apne umrah se halal ho. Agar use us ke umrah mein dushman roke to woh wahin halal ho jahan use roka.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Muzani ne ham ko apni kitab se aise hi padh kar sunaya; jabke woh hai: Wahin halal ho jahan roka gaya phir halal hokar wapas aaya phir ba'd mein umrah kiya jab aman pae jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya. Agar use bala roke yahan tak ke hajj faut ho jae to jab pahunche Baitullah ka aur Safa-Marwah ke darmiyan tawaf kare phir halq ya qasr kare phir apne hajj se halal hokar wapas aaya yahan tak ke agle saal hajj kare; woh hadi de. Agar hadi na pae to hajj mein teen din roza rakhe aur saat jab wapas aae."
"462","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair [bin Mut'im Raziyallahu anhu] se apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Arafah wale din apna oont talash karne gaya; main nikla to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Arafah mein logon ke sath wuqoof farmate the. To main ne kaha: Yeh Hums [Quraish] mein se hain; inhen Haram se bahar kya nikla? Hums se murad Quraish; Quraish Muzdalifah mein wuqoof karte aur kehte: Ham Hums hain; ham Haram se aage nahin badhenge."
"463","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Safwan (Rahimahullah) se apne mamun se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Arafah mein apne wuqoof ki jagah the. Sufyan kehte hain: Amr use imam ke wuqoof ki jagah se bahut door farmate. To Ibn Mirba Ansari hamare paas aaye aur kaha: 'Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka tumhari taraf rasool hun; woh tumhen hukm farmate hain ke apne in mashair par raho; tum apne walid Ibrahim (Alaihis-salam) ki wirasat par ho.'"
"464","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pachhne lagwaye jabke muhrim the."
"465","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi apne oont se gira; us ki gardan toot gayi; woh faut hua. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use pani aur beri se ghusl do, use us ke do kapdon mein kafnao, us ke sar ko na dhako; woh qayamat ke din ehram bandhte ya talbiyah kehte uthaya jaega.'"
"466","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi riwayat hai; unhon ne izafa farmaya: 'Use khushboo na lagao.'"
"467","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Ashamm [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah farmaya, woh us ki khala thin, jabke ghair muhrim the. Amr kehte hain: Main ne Zuhri ko Jabir bin Zaid ki Ibn Abbas se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees bayan ki ke Aap ne muhrim hokar nikah farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Yazid bin Ashamm ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghair muhrim hokar nikah farmaya. Amr kehte hain: Main ne kaha: Yazid kya jane jabke woh dehati peshab karne wala hai?! Kya tum use Ibn Abbas ke barabar karte ho?!"
"468","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar, Maimunah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja ke aazad karda ghulam [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Rafi apne aazad karda ghulam aur Ansar mein se ek aadmi ko bheja; unhon ne Aap ka Maimunah bint Haris se nikah farmaya jabke Aap Madinah mein the nikalne se pehle."
"469","[AI-translation] Nafi, Abdullah bin Umar ke aazad karda ghulam [Rahimahullah] se Nubaih bin Wahb, Banu Abdid-Dar ke bhai se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Ubaidullah ne Talhah bin Umar ka Syaibah bin Jubair ki beti se nikah karna chaha; unhon ne Aban bin Usman ko hazir hone ke liye bheja, woh hajj ke ameer the; dono muhrim the. To Aban ne us par us ka inkar farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Muhrim nikah na kare aur na karaye.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Usman bin Affan ki Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees se: 'Muhrim nikah na kare aur na karaye' ham lete hain; woh muttasil sabit sanad hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka Maimunah se nikah Hudaibiyah ke ba'd; un se milap umratul-qaza mein. Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) Aap ke sath dono safaron mein ikatthe aur qayam mein the. Usman Aap ke Makkah walon ki taraf rasool the; un ki wajah se bai'atur-rizwan nazil hui. Un ki hadees hamare nazdeek is mein sabit hai jo main ne un ki mushahida se bayan kiya. Agar koi kahe: Aurat ke ghar wale us ke nikah ko zyada jante hain agarche hazir na hon tawajjuh se zyada us se jo hazir janta hai jise us se un jaise tawajjuh nahin. Sulaiman bin Yasar un ke aazad karda ghulam ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se ghair muhrim hokar nikah farmaya; Yazid bin Ashamm un ki bahen ke bete ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se ghair muhrim hokar nikah farmaya. Un dono ke sath woh hai jo un dono se zyada sabit hai jo main ne tum se Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki riwayat se bayan kiya."
"470","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah se nikah nahin farmaya siwae halal [ghair ehram] hokar. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Us mein se jo is ko taqwiyat ke liye dalil hai ke Umar aur Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne do muhrimon ke nikah ko radd farmaya; Ibn Umar ne kaha: Muhrim nikah na kare aur na paigham de."
"471","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Hunain (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Abbas aur Miswar bin Makhramah ne Abwa mein ikhtilaf farmaya: Abdullah bin Abbas ne kaha: Muhrim apna sar dhoe. Miswar bin Makhramah ne kaha: Muhrim apna sar na dhoe. To Ibn Abbas ne mujhe Abu Ayyub Ansari ke paas bheja un se poochne; main ne unhen do lakdiyon [kunwan] se ghusl farmate paya jabke kapde se parde mein the. Ravi kehte hain: Main ne salam kiya; unhon ne kaha: Yeh kaun hai? Ravi kehte hain: Main ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Hunain hun; Ibn Abbas ne mujhe tumhare paas bheja tum se poochne ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muhrim hokar apna sar kaise dhote the? Ravi kehte hain: To Abu Ayyub ne kapde par apna hath rakha aur use neecha farmaya yahan tak ke mujhe un ka sar zahir hua; phir un par dalne wale insan se kaha: 'Dalo.' To us ne un ke sar par dala phir unhon ne apne sar ko apne dono hathon se harkat di; use aage aur peeche farmaya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Aise hi main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko karte dekha."
"472","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hafsah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Logon ka kya haal hai ke woh halal hue jabke Aap apne umrah se halal nahin hue? Aap ne farmaya: 'Main ne apne sar ko libbad [gond se jama] farmaya aur apni hadi ko haar pehnaya; main halal nahin hota yahan tak ke zibah karun.'"
"473","[AI-translation] Urwah [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Usamah bin Zaid se poocha, main un ke sath baitha tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hajjatul-wada mein wapas hote kaise chalte the? Unhon ne kaha: 'Aap anaq [tez darmiyani] chalte; jab khula maidan pate to nass [zyada tez] farmate.' Malik kehte hain: Hisham ne kaha: Nass anaq se upar hai. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Isma'il bin Yahya ne ham ko Kinanah se Hisham bin Urwah se apne walid se aise hi bayan farmaya: Ke unhon ne Usamah bin Zaid se poocha, main un ke sath baitha tha. Yeh ghalat hai; kyunke Hisham ne Usamah ko nahin dekha; jabke hamare nazdeek, wallahu a'lam, woh hai ke unhon ne Usamah bin Zaid se ek aadmi ne poocha, main un ke sath baitha tha, yahan tak ke baithna Urwah ki taraf laute."
"474","[AI-translation] Hisham [Rahimahullah] se apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Usamah bin Zaid se poocha gaya, main un ke pehlu mein tha; woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche Arafah se Muzdalifah tak sawar the: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chalna kaisa tha? Unhon ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) anaq chalte; jab khula maidan pate to nass farmate. Hisham kehte hain: Nass anaq se upar hai. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Jo ham ne Sufyan ki is hadees mein zikr kiya: Usamah se poocha gaya, main un ke pehlu mein tha; woh Urwah ke kalam mein se hai hamare gumaan ke mutabiq Malik ki Hisham se us se pehle hadees se."
"475","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Abi Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abdullah bin Umar ko Aishah (Raziyallahu anha), Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne nahin dekha ke tumhari qaum ne jab Ka'ba banaya to Ibrahim (Alaihis-salam) ki bunyadon se kotahi ki?' To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya Aap use Ibrahim ki bunyadon par wapas nahin farmayenge? To Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar tumhari qaum kufr se nai na hoti to main use us par wapas farmata jis par woh tha.' Ravi kehte hain: To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Agar Aishah ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna to main nahin samajhta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hijr wale dono ruknon ko chhuna tark farmaya siwae is ke ke Baitullah Ibrahim (Alaihis-salam) ki bunyadon par mukammal nahin farmaya gaya."
"476","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Juraij [Rahimahullah], Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Muzani ne ham ko aise hi bayan farmaya; jabke woh Ubaid bin Juraij hain, se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se kaha: Ai Abu Abdir Rahman, main tumhen chaar karte dekhta hun jo main tumhare sahaba mein se kisi ko karte nahin dekhta. Unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hain Ai Ibn Juraij? Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen dekhta hun ruknon mein se Yamani do ke siwa nahin chhute; main tumhen sibtiah jotiyan pehente dekhta hun; main tumhen peele se rangte dekhta hun; main tumhen dekhta hun jab Makkah mein ho log ehram bandhte hain jab chand dekhte hain jabke tum ehram nahin bandhte yahan tak ke tarwiyah ka din ho. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: 'Rahi rukn: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Yamani do ke siwa chhute nahin dekha. Rahi sibtiah jotiyan: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko jotiyan pehente dekha jin mein baal nahin hain aur un mein wuzu farmate; main pehenna pasand karta hun. Rahi peela: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us se rangte dekha; main us se rangna pasand karta hun. Rahi ehram: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ehram bandhte nahin dekha yahan tak ke Aap ki oontni Aap ko lekar chale.'"
"477","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdir Rahman bin Naufal bin Haris bin Abdul-Muttalib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use bayan kiya ke unhon ne Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas aur Zahhak bin Qais ko suna, Mu'awiyah bin Abi Sufyan ke hajj wale saal; dono umrah se hajj tak tamattu ka zikr karte the. To Zahhak ne kaha: Use sirf woh karta hai jo Allah Azz wa Jall ke hukm se jahil ho. To Sa'd (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Tum ne bura kaha Ai mere bhatije. To Zahhak ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us se mana farmaya tha. To Sa'd rehmatullah alaih ne kaha: 'Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use kiya aur ham ne Aap ke sath use kiya.'"
"478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo oont hank raha tha; Aap ne us se farmaya: 'Us par sawar ho.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh oont [hadya] hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Us par sawar ho, tumhen kharabi ho' dusri ya teesri [martaba] mein."
"479","[AI-translation] Zainab bint Abi Salamah (Rahimahallah) se Umm Salamah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se shikayat ki ke main beemar hun. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Logon ke peeche se sawari par tawaf karo.' Ravi kehte hain: To main ne tawaf kiya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us waqt Baitullah ke pehlu mein namaz padh rahe the; Aap Wat-Toor wa kitabin mastoor padh rahe the."
"480","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zulhulaifah wali Batha mein oont bithaya; Aap ne us mein namaz padhi. Nafi kehte hain: Abdullah bin Umar aisa karte."
"481","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni hadi ka ba'z apne hath se zibah farmaya; ba'z ghair ne zibah farmaya."
"482","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ai Allah, muhalliqeen [mundne walon] par rehem farma.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur muqassireen [katwane walon] par Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Ai Allah, muhalliqeen par rehem farma.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur muqassireen par Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur muqassireen par.'"
"483","[AI-translation] Abu Ya'fur (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Khuza'ah ke ek aadmi ko suna jab Ibn Zubair Makkah mein qatl kiye gae, woh Makkah ka ameer tha, kehte: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya: 'Ai Abu Hafs, tum taqatwar aadmi ho; rukn par bheed na karo; tum kamzor ko takleef dete ho. Lekin agar khalwat pao to chhuo; warna takbeer kaho aur guzar jao.' Sufyan kehte hain: Woh Abdur Rahman bin Nafi bin Abdul-Haris hain; Hajjaj ne use us par us se wapsi mein muqarrar farmaya jab Ibn Zubair qatl kiye gae."
"484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hajjatul-wada mein Mina mein logon ke Aap se poochne ke liye thehre. To Aap ke paas ek aadmi aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe khabar na hui; main ne zibah se pehle mundwaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Zibah karo, koi harj nahin.' To Aap ke paas dusra aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe khabar na hui; main ne rami se pehle zibah kiya? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Rami karo, koi harj nahin.' Ravi kehte hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aage peeche ki kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin poocha gaya siwae farmaya: 'Karo, koi harj nahin.'"
"485","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki talbiyah: 'Labbaika Allahumma labbaika, labbaika la shareeka laka labbaika, innal-hamda wan-ni'mata laka wal-mulka la shareeka laka [Main hazir hun Ai Allah main hazir hun, main hazir hun Tere siwa koi shareek nahin main hazir hun, hamd nemat aur badshahat Tere liye hai Tere siwa koi shareek nahin].' Nafi kehte hain: Abdullah bin Umar us mein izafa farmate: Labbaika labbaika labbaika wa sa'daika walkhairu fi yadaika warrughba ilaika wal-amal."
"486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah Ansari [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Hajar Aswad se daudte [ramal] dekha yahan tak ke us tak pahunche teen pheron mein."
"487","[AI-translation] Abdir Rahman bin Qasim (Rahimahullah) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Asma bint Umais ne Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ko Baida mein jana; Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use hukm do ke ghusl kare phir ehram bandhe.'"
"488","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ham Baida mein the to Asma bint Umais ne Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ko jana; yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use hukm do ke ghusl kare', ya ravi ne kaha: 'Unhen hukm do ke ghusl karen phir ehram bandhen.' Shak Shafi'i se hai."
"489","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazid ke walid [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Banu Zuhrah ke sheikh ko bheja jo hamare ghar walon mein se the; main sheikh ke sath Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gaya jabke woh Hijr mein the. To unhon ne un se wilaadon mein se wilaad ke bare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: Aurat Jahiliyat mein jab us ka shauhar use talaq deta ya us se faut hota to woh iddat ke baghair nikah karti. To aadmi kehta: Rahi nutfah Fulan se hai; rahi bachcha Fulan ke bistar par hai. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tun ne sach kaha; lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya 'bachcha bistar [sahih nikah wale malik] ke liye hai.'"
"490","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bachcha bistar ke liye hai; zanakar ke liye pathar [koi haq nahin].'"
"491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Abd bin Zam'ah aur Sa'd ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Zam'ah ki bandi ke bete ke bare mein jhagda farmaya. To Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere bhai ne mujhe wasiyat ki thi jab main Makkah aaon ke Zam'ah ki bandi ke bete ko dekhun; main use lun; woh mera beta hai. To Abd bin Zam'ah ne kaha: Mera bhai aur mere walid ki bandi ka beta; mere walid ke bistar par paida hua. To Aap ne Utbah se wazeh mushabihat dekhi. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh tumhara hai Ai Abd bin Zam'ah; bachcha bistar ke liye hai; us se parda karo Ai Saudah.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Abar-Raddad Abdullah bin Abdis-Salam ko kehte suna: Main ne Abdul-Malik bin Hisham Nahwi ko kehte suna: Woh Zam'ah hain, yani fathah ke sath."
"492","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Utbah bin Abi Waqqas ne apne bhai Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ko wasiyat ki thi ke Zam'ah ki walidah [bachcha janne wali bandi] ka beta mujh se hai; use apne paas lo. Jab Fath wale saal to Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ne use liya aur kaha: Mere bhai ka beta; mere bhai ne mujhe us mein wasiyat ki thi. To Abd bin Zam'ah ne kaha: Mera bhai mere walid ki walidah ka beta; us ke bistar par paida hua. To dono use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae. To Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ne kaha: Mere bhai ne mujhe us mein wasiyat ki thi. To Abd bin Zam'ah ne kaha: Mera bhai aur mere walid ki walidah ka beta; us ke bistar par paida hua. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh tumhara hai Ai Abd bin Zam'ah.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bachcha bistar ke liye hai; zanakar ke liye pathar.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Saudah bint Zam'ah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja se farmaya: 'Us se parda karo Ai Saudah' us ki Utbah se mushabihat dekhne ki wajah se. Unhon ne use Allah Azz wa Jall se milne tak nahin dekha."
"493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid Juhani [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; us ne Aap se luqatah [giri padi cheez] ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Us ki thaili aur us ki rassi pehchano, phir us ka ek saal ailaan karo. Agar us ka malik aae [de do]; agar nahin to tumhara us se mamla hai [istemal karo].' Us ne kaha: Gumshuda bakri? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare liye, ya tumhare bhai ke liye, ya bhediye ke liye.' Us ne kaha: Gumshuda oont? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhara us se kya mamla; us ke paas us ka pani aur us ke joote [mazbooti] hain; woh pani par aata hai aur darakht khata hai yahan tak ke use us ka malik mile.'"
"494","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir [Raziyallahu anhuma] se apne walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne bete ko ghulam diya; woh use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae taake Aap ko gawah banayen. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne apne har bete ko aisa diya?' Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'To use wapas karo.'"
"495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lae. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne apne is bete ko apna ghulam diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne apne har bete ko aisa diya?' To unhon ne kaha: Nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To use wapas karo.'"
"496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ka padosi us se apni deewar mein lakdi gadne ki ijazat mange to use na roke.' Jab Abu Hurairah ne unhen yeh bayan kiya to unhon ne apne sar jhukaye. To unhon ne kaha: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhen us se moo modte dekhta hun! Allah ki qasam, main use tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan phenkunga [pahunchata rahunga].'"
"497","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi apne padosi ko apni deewar mein lakdi gadne se na roke.' Ravi kehte hain: Phir Abu Hurairah kehte: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhen us se moo modte dekhta hun! Allah ki qasam, main use tumhare kandhon ke darmiyan phenkunga."
"498","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib aur Hiram bin Sa'd bin Muhayyisah [Rahimahumallah] se riwayat hai ke Bara bin Azib ki oontni qaum ke bagh mein dakhil hui aur fasad kiya. 'To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke maal walon par apne maal ki din mein hifazat hai; maweshi walon par jo un ke maweshi raat mein fasad karen' , ya ravi ne kaha: 'Jo un ke maweshi pahunchayen.'"
"499","[AI-translation] Hiram bin Sa'd bin Muhayyisah [Rahimahullah] se riwayat hai ke Bara bin Azib ki oontni ek aadmi ke bagh mein dakhil hui aur us mein fasad kiya. 'To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke baghon walon par din mein un ki hifazat hai; jo maweshi raat mein fasad karen woh un walon par zaman hai.'"
"500","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Zaid pani ko na roko taake us se ghaas roko.'"
"501","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Zaid pani ko na roko taake us se ghaas roko.'"
"502","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma [bint Abi Bakr Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri walida mere paas aayi chaahte hue [milne] Quraish ke zamane mein; main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya main un se silrahmi karun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Ji.'"
"503","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri walida mere paas aayi jabke mushrikah thin Quraish ke zamane mein jab unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ehd kiya tha; main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se fatwa manga. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah: Meri walida mere paas aayi jabke mushrikah chaahte hue [milne]; kya main un se silrahmi karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ji, apni walida se silrahmi karo.'"
"504","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Ubadah se, apne walid se apne dada se [Rahimahumallah], riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Ubadah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Aap ki ba'z jang mein nikle; un ki walida ko Madinah mein wafaat aa pahunchi. To un se kaha gaya: Wasiyat karo. To unhon ne kaha: Main kis mein wasiyat karun? Maal Sa'd ka maal hai. To woh Sa'd ke aane se pehle faut huin. Jab Sa'd aae to is ka zikr un se kiya gaya. To Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah: Kya unhen faida dega ke main un ki taraf se sadqa karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ji.' To Sa'd ne kaha: Falan falan bagh un ki taraf se sadqa hai, us bagh ke liye jis ka unhon ne naam liya."
"505","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Meri walida achanak faut huin; main samajhta hun agar woh bolten to sadqa karten. Kya main un ki taraf se sadqa karun? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ji.' To us ne un ki taraf se sadqa kiya."
"506","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Khaibar ke sau hisse malik the jo unhon ne khareede; unhon ne unhen jama kiya. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah: Main ne maal paya jo main ne aisa kabhi nahin paya; main ne chaha ke us se Allah ka qurb hasil karun. To Aap ne un se farmaya: 'Asl ko rok do, phal ko jari karo [waqf].' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Yeh musha [ghair taqseem shuda] ke rokne ke jawaz par dalalat karta hai jaisa Abu Yusuf aur Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne kaha. Agar hamare liye yeh jaiz na hota to us par dalalat karti Ibn Aun ki Nafi se Ibn Umar se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees Aap ke Umar ko hukm ke bare mein ke woh apna Khaibar ka maal roken jis par Aap ne use rokne ka hukm diya jab unhon ne Aap se is ke bare mein poocha. Kyunke Khaibar taqseem nahin hui siwae Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke zamane mein. Rahi jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein us mein tha, woh sirf majmu ki taqseem hai; kyunke Aap ne har sau hisse ko ek hisse jaise farmaya, phir us ki paidawar ko us par taqseem farmaya; zameen taqseem nahin farmai."
"507","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hind, Mu'awiyah ki walida ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Abu Sufyan kanjoos hain; mere liye un se siwae us ke kuch nahin jo woh mujhe dakhil karen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Jo tumhen aur tumhare bete ko kafi ho maroof ke sath lo.'"
"508","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use bayan kiya ke Hind, Mu'awiyah ki walida Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi. Unhon ne kaha: Abu Sufyan kanjoos hain; woh mujhe jo mujhe aur mere bete ko kafi ho nahin dete siwae jo main us se chhup kar lun jabke woh nahin jante. Kya mujh par us mein kuch hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo tumhen aur tumhare bete ko kafi ho maroof ke sath lo.'"
"509","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas [Raziyallahu anhu] se apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Fath wale saal beemar hua jis se marne ke qareeb hua; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri iyadat ke liye tashreef lae. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas bahut maal hai; mujhe sirf meri beti waris hoti hai; kya main apne do tihai maal se sadqa karun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Main ne kaha: Aadha? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Main ne kaha: Tihai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tihai; tihai bahut hai. Tum apne warison ko ghani chhoro behtar hai is se ke unhen mohtaj chhoro logon se mangte. Tum koi kharch nahin karoge siwae us par ajr diye jaoge yahan tak ke luqma jo tum apni biwi ke munh tak uthao.' Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya main apni hijrat se peeche chhora jaunga? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum agar mere ba'd peeche raho aur Allah ke chehre ka irada karte amal karo siwae us se bulandi aur darje mein badhoge. Ho sakta hai tum peeche raho; tum se qaumon ko nafa ho, dusron ko tum se nuqsan ho. Ai Allah, mere sahaba ki hijrat puri farma; unhen un ki ediyon par na lauta. Lekin bechara Sa'd bin Khaulah.' Aap us par afsos farmate, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), ke woh Makkah mein faut hua."
"510","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri iyadat ke liye tashreef lae hajjatul-wada wale saal us dard se jo mujh mein sakht tha. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujh tak us dard se pahunch chuka jo tum dekhte ho; main maal wala hun; mujhe sirf meri beti waris hoti hai; kya main apne do tihai maal se sadqa karun? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' To main ne kaha: Aadha? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Phir main ne kaha: Tihai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tihai; tihai bahut ya badi hai. Tum apne warison ko ghani chhoro behtar hai is se ke unhen mohtaj chhoro logon se mangte. Tum koi kharch nahin karoge jis se Allah ka chehra chahte ho siwae us par ajr diye jaoge yahan tak ke jo tum apni biwi [ke munh] mein rakho.' Ravi kehte hain: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya main apne sahaba ke ba'd peeche chhora jaunga? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum peeche nahin chhore jaoge aur nek amal karoge siwae us se darje aur bulandi mein badhoge. Ho sakta hai tum peeche raho yahan tak ke tum se qaumon ko nafa ho, dusron ko tum se nuqsan ho. Ai Allah, mere sahaba ki hijrat puri farma; unhen un ki ediyon par na lauta.' Lekin bechara Sa'd bin Khaulah; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us par afsos farmate ke woh Makkah mein faut hua."
"511","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kisi aadmi ka haq nahin jo wasiyat par iman rakhta hai jabke us ke paas maal ho jis mein woh wasiyat kare us par do raaten guzren siwae us ki wasiyat us ke paas likhi hui ho.'"
"512","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kisi Musalman aadmi ka haq nahin jis ke paas kuch ho jis mein woh wasiyat kare do raaten rahe siwae us ki wasiyat us ke paas likhi hui ho.'"
"513","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Woh wasiyat ko qarz se pehle padhte hain; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qarz se wasiyat se pehle ka faisla farmaya.'"
"514","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo qasam par hale taake us se Musalman aadmi ka maal kate, woh Allah se milega jabke Woh us par ghazabnak hai.' Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham ko Kitabullah se padh kar sunaya ﴿إِنَّ الَّذِينَ يَشْتَرُونَ بِعَهْدِ اللَّهِ وَأَيْمَانِهِمْ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا﴾ [Aal Imran: 77] ayat."
"515","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b [bin Malik Raziyallahu anhu] se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo qasam par hale taake us se Musalman aadmi ka maal kate, woh Allah se milega jabke Woh us par ghazabnak hai.' Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, agarche thodi cheez ho? Aap ne farmaya: 'Agarche arak ka miswak ho.'"
"516","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo mere is mimbar par gunah wali qasam khae, woh apna thikana aag se banae.'"
"517","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Musalman aadmi ka haq apni qasam se kate, Allah us par jannat haram farmata hai aur us ke liye aag wajib farmata hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Agarche thodi cheez ho Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Agarche arak ki tehni ho.' Aap ne use teen martaba farmaya."
